<p>Monrovia's established trees are beautiful — but they fill gutters constantly. Pine needles accumulate year-round. Oak and maple leaves blanket everything in fall. Without regular cleaning, debris compacts into sludge that blocks water flow.</p>

<p>When gutters clog, water overflows. That overflow erodes landscaping, damages siding, and pools around foundations. On Monrovia's clay soil, that water doesn't drain away — it finds its way into basements and crawlspaces.</p>

<p>Professional cleaning is faster, safer, and more thorough than DIY attempts. We're just 12 miles away and can schedule quickly when your gutters need attention.</p>
{% endset %}

{% set service_explanation %}
<p>We remove all debris by hand — leaves, needles, shingle grit, and accumulated gunk. We don't just blow debris around.</p>

<p>We flush all downspouts to ensure they're clear. Clogged downspouts make clean gutters useless.</p>

<p>We inspect your entire system for problems: loose hangers, small leaks, fascia damage. You'll know your gutters' condition when we're done.</p>
{% endset %}

